# The repo-root .gitignore has `*.log` which would swallow every .repro.log,
# .server.log, and bench_serving .log under here. We explicitly want:
#   - Small *.repro.log summaries → TRACKED (headline numbers).
#   - Small throughput/*_c*_s*.log summaries → TRACKED.
#   - *.server.log uncompressed traces → NOT tracked (tens of MB each).
#   - *.server.log.gz compressed traces → TRACKED (~10× smaller, still parseable
#     via parse_logs.py which handles both suffixes).
!results/**/*.repro.log
!results/**/*.server.log.gz
!results/throughput/**/*.log
results/**/*.server.log
